<Group labelreference="L490" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" bold="true" layout="Normal" alignment="centred"><Font bold="true">MATH 4503/6503 worksheet 7: introduction to partial differential equations in Maple</Font></Text-field><Text-field style="Text" bold="true" layout="Normal" alignment="centred"></Text-field><Text-field style="Text" bold="true" size="14" layout="Normal" alignment="centred"><Font size="12" bold="false">Irfan Javed</Font><Font size="14" bold="false">
</Font><Font size="12" bold="false" italic="true">March 6, 2026</Font></Text-field><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" alignment="centred"></Text-field><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">The purpose of this worksheet is to give a (very brief) introduction to partial differential equations (PDEs) and Maple's capabilities to solve them both analytically and numerically. We will be making extensive use of the routines contained in <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">PDEtools</Font>, which has been loaded after the <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">restart</Font> command above.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Section collapsed="false" isCollapsible="true" drawButton="true" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title><Text-field style="Heading 1" layout="Heading 1">Analytically solving PDEs using <Font size="18" style="Maple Input" executable="false">pdsolve</Font></Text-field></Title>
<Group labelreference="L463" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">restart;
with(PDEtools):
with(plots):</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L491" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Normal" layout="Normal">The following PDEs are classic examples of the different classes of second order equations I introduced in the beginning of the course:</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L485" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">parabolic := diff(u(t, x), t)-d*diff(u(t, x), x, x) = 0;
hyperbolic := diff(u(t, x), t, t)-c^2*diff(u(t, x), x, x) = 0;
elliptic := diff(u(x, y), x, x)+diff(u(x, y), y, y) = 0;</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SSpwYXJhYm9saWNHRigvLCYtSSVkaWZmR0YmNiQtSSJ1R0YoNiRJInRHRihJInhHRihGNiIiIiomSSJkR0YoRjgtRjE2JEYzLUkiJEdGJjYkRjciIiNGOCEiIiIiITcjLywmRjBGOComRjpGOC1GMTYkLUYxNiRGM0Y3RjdGOEZBRkI=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SStoeXBlcmJvbGljR0YoLywmLUklZGlmZkdGJjYkLUkidUdGKDYkSSJ0R0YoSSJ4R0YoLUkiJEdGJjYkRjYiIiMiIiIqJkkiY0dGKEY7LUYxNiRGMy1GOTYkRjdGO0Y8ISIiIiIhNyMvLCYtRjE2JC1GMTYkRjNGNkY2RjwqJkY+RjstRjE2JC1GMTYkRjNGN0Y3RjxGQ0ZE</Equation></Text-field>
